# Build outputs from verification and hand-off builds. Only `dist/` was ignored, so every
# dist-<name>/ a verify tier or an agent produced was untracked-but-addable - and the round
# commit uses `git add -A`. Two of them (518 MB) were one commit away from the history on
# 2026-08-25. This does NOT untrack the ~22.6k dist files already in the index; that is a
# separate, deliberate cleanup.
dist-*/
